    pr_ref:  # 448c
    description: "The event-sourcing linker only detects 3 framework patterns: Spring @EventListener/ApplicationEventPublisher, JS EventEmitter emit/on, Django signals. Repos using custom event systems (keycloak ProviderEventListener, kafka's internal KafkaEventQueue, Akka event bus, Go channels-as-events) produce zero event edges. Surfaced during INV-bivot bakeoff validation: kafka (91MB Java codebase implementing a message broker) had zero event_publishes edges because its internal event infrastructure doesn't match any detected pattern. Expand pattern set to cover: (1) custom Java event bus patterns (register/fire/dispatch), (2) Go channel-based event patterns, (3) Akka/Vert.x event bus, (4) generic publish/subscribe method name heuristics."  # 448c
